---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="留言板">
  <div class="wrap" style="padding-top: 44px; padding-bottom: 56px; max-width: 680px;">
    <div class="term">
      <div class="term-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="title">豆芽@blog: ~/guestbook — zsh</span></div>
      <div class="term-body">
        <span class="line"><span class="prompt">➜ ~</span> <span class="cmd">./guestbook --open</span></span>

        <div class="gb-content">
          <h2>留言板</h2>
          <p>随便写点什么——路过的痕迹、想聊的话题、对博客的建议，或者只是打个招呼。</p>

          <div class="gb-options">
            <a class="gb-btn" href="https://github.com/zhaojiale001016/zhaojiale001016.github.io/discussions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <span class="icon">💬</span>
              <span class="label">GitHub Discussions</span>
              <span class="desc">登录 GitHub 后直接留言，支持 Markdown</span>
            </a>
            <a class="gb-btn" href="https://github.com/zhaojiale001016/zhaojiale001016.github.io/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <span class="icon">📋</span>
              <span class="label">GitHub Issue</span>
              <span class="desc">提建议、报 bug、交换友链</span>
            </a>
            <a class="gb-btn" href="/posts/ai-coding-review-cost#comments">
              <span class="icon">✍️</span>
              <span class="label">文章评论区</span>
              <span class="desc">每篇文章底部都有 Giscus 评论区</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="gb-note">
            <p>三种方式都会收到通知，通常 24 小时内回复。不登录 GitHub 也可以通过 <a href="/subscribe">邮件订阅</a> 保持联系。</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <span class="line" style="margin-top: 18px;"><span class="prompt">➜ ~</span> <span class="cursor">&nbsp;</span></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .gb-content { margin-top: 16px; }
  .gb-content h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--green); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .gb-content p { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.7; }
  .gb-options { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin: 20px 0; }
  .gb-btn {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
    background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 16px 18px;
    transition: border-color .15s, transform .15s;
  }
  .gb-btn:hover { border-color: var(--green); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .gb-btn .icon { font-size: 1.3rem; }
  .gb-btn .label { font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
  .gb-btn .desc { font-size: .72rem; color: var(--ink-3); margin-left: auto; }
  .gb-note { margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .gb-note p { font-size: .78rem; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .gb-note a { color: var(--green); }
</style>
